<plain>
<text x="-12.7" y="104.14" size="1.778" layer="95">TTY local loop supply can be </text>
<text x="-12.7" y="101.6" size="1.778" layer="95">50-70 V. Use 80V optocouplers!</text>
<text x="172.72" y="33.02" size="1.778" layer="95">20mA Tx loop</text>
<text x="38.1" y="-7.62" size="1.778" layer="95">20mA Rx loop</text>
<text x="-12.7" y="109.22" size="1.778" layer="95">48VAC power available from TTY</text>
<text x="165.1" y="78.74" size="1.778" layer="95">TDC Relay loop</text>
<text x="40.64" y="55.88" size="1.778" layer="95">Connect to a DTE port with null modem cable</text>
<text x="121.92" y="60.96" size="1.778" layer="95">Passive 1-2,  Active 1-3 &amp; 2-4</text>
<text x="71.12" y="10.16" size="1.778" layer="95">Passive 1-2,  Active 1-3 &amp; 2-4</text>
<text x="10.16" y="71.12" size="1.778" layer="95" ratio="15" rot="R90">DE-9 Female (TTY)</text>
</plain>
